    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "The main goal in Diamond Caves is to get out of a cave by collecting enough Emeralds and Diamonds for the exit to open. This can be quite tricky because you are not alone in the cave, there are a few different enemies as well as special items such as doors, keys, acid pools, teleporters, bombs &amp; dynamite and much more...<br><br>The game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> classic 16bit graphics and sound<br></li><li> full mouse/keyboard or controller support<br></li><li> single player and split-screen co-op<br></li><li> Several groups of Levels of various difficulty: 200 single player levels and 100 teamwork levels<br></li><li> each Level with its own Highscore-Leaderboard<br></li><li> unlock bonus Levels and Steam achievements<br></li><li> Level Editor included<br></li><li> Steam Workshop support: download user generated levels</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The main goal in Diamond Caves is to get out of a cave by collecting enough Emeralds and Diamonds for the exit to open. This can be quite tricky because you are not alone in the cave, there are a few different enemies as well as special items such as doors, keys, acid pools, teleporters, bombs &amp; dynamite and much more...<br><br>The game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> classic 16bit graphics and sound<br></li><li> full mouse/keyboard or controller support<br></li><li> single player and split-screen co-op<br></li><li> Several groups of Levels of various difficulty: 200 single player levels and 100 teamwork levels<br></li><li> each Level with its own Highscore-Leaderboard<br></li><li> unlock bonus Levels and Steam achievements<br></li><li> Level Editor included<br></li><li> Steam Workshop support: download user generated levels</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Diamond Caves is a classic arcade puzzle games related to the good old 8bit and 16bit days. Get out of a cave by collect all the Emeralds and Diamonds and beware of traps and monsters... now with level editor!",
